        "original_id": "c43475b3-29fc-5c7b-af55-c44dd32a5c20",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cate Blanchett, Tom Tykwer, Giovanni Ribisi, Katharine Hepburn, Martin Scorsese\n- Films: Heaven, The Aviator\n- Topics: acting awards, film roles\n\nFacts:\n- Cate Blanchett was born on 14 May 1969 and is an Australian actress and theatre director.\n- Heaven is a 2002 romantic thriller film directed by Tom Tykwer and starring Cate Blanchett and Giovanni Ribisi.\n- In 2004, Cate Blanchett portrayed Katharine Hepburn in Martin Scorsese's film The Aviator.\n- Cate Blanchett's performance in The Aviator brought her critical acclaim and many accolades, including the Academy Award for Best Actress in a Supporting Role.\n- Cate Blanchett became the only actor to win an Oscar for portraying another Oscar-winning actor.",
